sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant S as Station
    participant I as Ingest
    participant D as DB
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant M as Model
    participant F as Output
    participant P as Parser
    participant A as API
    participant C as Console

    S->>I: Telemetry<br/>44-byte BE frame
    Note over I: CRC-16<br/>Decode x100<br/>QC checks

    I->>D: INSERT reading
    Note over I,D: sqlite3 via popen()

    O->>D: SELECT readings
    D-->>O: Seasonal series

    Note over O: Build MERIDIAN.DAT<br/>MRD-201<br/>Weather + soil inputs
    O->>M: Run cropmod<br/>ASCII deck

    Note over M: Water balance<br/>Crop growth
    M->>F: Daily results<br/>ASCII

    F-->>P: MERIDIAN.OUT
    Note over P: COLS parsing<br/>ForecastResult DTO
    P->>D: Commit forecast

    C->>A: GET /api/series
    A->>D: sqlite3 -json
    D-->>A: JSON
    A-->>C: HTTP 200

    Note over C: Update #series<br/>Render #chart